title: "Physics-Informed Neural Representation of a Timelike FLRW Geodesic: Conformal First Integrals and Affine Reconstruction"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Aeenehvand
    given-names: Tahereh
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a controlled comparison of raw affine second-order,
  scaled affine, and conformal first-integral PINN representations of a timelike
  geodesic in a prescribed matter-dominated FLRW background.
